        {
          "kicker": "Coaching staff",
          "heading": "Senirusi Seruvakula to remain involved in Flying Fijians coaching setup",
          "body": "Senirusi Seruvakula, who was interim coach through July, will remain involved in the Flying Fijians setup, FBC News reports. Mick Byrne left the role in April, and Jake White, the former South Africa coach, was appointed head coach ahead of the 2027 World Cup. White's full backroom staff has yet to be officially confirmed by Fiji. Their last outing was a 34-28 win over Japan."
        },
