      "edition": "Saturday 7 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Oscar Jegou ruled out with rib injury; Esteban Capilla named for Fiji",
          "body": "Oscar Jegou is out of Saturday's clash with Fiji after a rib injury sustained in training, and head coach Fabien Galthié has named uncapped loose forward Esteban Capilla in the matchday 23. Capilla could make his France debut off the bench. Kalvin Gourgues gets his first start for Les Bleus in midfield, after four appearances off the bench, in a side already missing Thibaud Flament, Emmanuel Meafou and Matthieu Jalibert."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Italy lose Nacho Brex and Tommaso Menoncello to injury before Springboks",
