    "390": {
      "date": "2026-11-07",
      "edition": "Saturday 7 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Captain's verdict",
          "heading": "Sione Tuipulotu says Scotland have progressed since 17-17 All Blacks near miss",
          "body": "Captain Sione Tuipulotu says the squad has grown since last year's All Blacks match, when Scotland came back from 17-0 down to 17-17 only to lose to a late Damien McKenzie score. \"I do feel like we've progressed a lot in the last 12 months,\" he said. Since then, they have broken England's 12-game winning run, scored 50 points against France and pushed world champions South Africa close in Pretoria. New Zealand have won 31 of the 33 meetings so far."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
