          "kicker": "Dublin defeat",
          "heading": "Pumas fall 42-12 to Ireland in Dublin as Hugo Keenan scores hat-trick",
          "body": "Argentina went to the Aviva Stadium on Friday night chasing a first win in Dublin and fell well short. BBC Sport had noted beforehand that the Pumas have never won there, and that Ireland had taken 14 of the 20 previous meetings between the sides. Argentina have won all three of their World Cup meetings with Ireland, and each time it ended Ireland's tournament early."
